      Obtained my bachelor's in Data Science and moved to a PhD in Computer Science in 2020.
    </p>

    <p>
      When time allows, I enjoy a good soccer or frisbee game. Taking out a day to camp out in
      the woods and explore unseen areas is of high-reward too.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Enjoy reading informative books</li>
